{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And I will gather</b> — This is the battle in which the children of Moab, the children of Ammon, and Seir joined together, a heavy force, very great in number. And Jehoshaphat had from Judah and from Benjamin one thousand thousand and one hundred and sixty thousand mighty warriors. And the Valley of Jehoshaphat — it is the Valley of Berachah, for Jehoshaphat called its name thus."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:41.463285328Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}